{"3726240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sunny's Odyssey", "steam_appid": 3726240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726240/extras/b654571a2316177c2dbac5f3e1a236ba.avif?t=1787777060\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726240/extras_big/b654571a2316177c2dbac5f3e1a236ba.avif?t=1787777060 width=800 height=453 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CELESTIA AND THE CELESTIAL TOWER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Celestia was once a colorful and peaceful village where Sunny, a young and fearless adventurer lived, alongside Dante, her magical pet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, while Sunny was away on an expedition, the evil Purrphett and his minions attacked the village and captured all the inhabitants’ pets, retreating to the Celestial Tower, a sanctuary once protected by the Guardians of Celestia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon her return, Sunny found her village desolate and its people frozen in time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With her brave companion Dante, the two set off toward the Celestial Tower, determined to defeat Purrphett and lift the curse that had befallen Celestia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORATION AND PUZZLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Sunny and her pets as you climb the floors of the Celestial Tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve elemental puzzles, find hidden treasures, and discover secret locations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware... Purrphett’s minions are hot on your trail!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TACTICAL TURN-BASED COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in epic turn-based battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically choose your units and skillfully arrange their abilities in your spell bar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move across the grid, charge your mana, and unleash your elemental power!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play even when it’s not your turn: perform parries and real-time boosts at any moment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726240/extras/b654571a2316177c2dbac5f3e1a236ba.avif?t=1787777060\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726240/extras_big/b654571a2316177c2dbac5f3e1a236ba.avif?t=1787777060 width=800 height=453 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CELESTIA AND THE CELESTIAL TOWER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Celestia was once a colorful and peaceful village where Sunny, a young and fearless adventurer lived, alongside Dante, her magical pet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, while Sunny was away on an expedition, the evil Purrphett and his minions attacked the village and captured all the inhabitants’ pets, retreating to the Celestial Tower, a sanctuary once protected by the Guardians of Celestia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon her return, Sunny found her village desolate and its people frozen in time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With her brave companion Dante, the two set off toward the Celestial Tower, determined to defeat Purrphett and lift the curse that had befallen Celestia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORATION AND PUZZLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Sunny and her pets as you climb the floors of the Celestial Tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve elemental puzzles, find hidden treasures, and discover secret locations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware... Purrphett’s minions are hot on your trail!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TACTICAL TURN-BASED COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in epic turn-based battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically choose your units and skillfully arrange their abilities in your spell bar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move across the grid, charge your mana, and unleash your elemental power!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play even when it’s not your turn: perform parries and real-time boosts at any moment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Embark on a journey with Sunny and her magical pets to conquer the Celestial Tower, a once peaceful domain now taken over by an enigmatic figure. Explore the dungeon, solve puzzles, and win turn-based battles with real time mechanics to lift the curse that looms over your village.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726240/72dca13b5e277328aff53030253f450aa1f7a35c/header.jpg?t=1787777060", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726240/ecf39590c47cb0f8b2838235ad15983c396a9636/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787777060", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726240/ecf39590c47cb0f8b2838235ad15983c396a9636/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787777060", "website": "https://www.starlight-games-studio.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Inter Core i5-2300 / AMD FX-4350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 460 768 MB / AMD Radeon HD 6870 1 GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [],